sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant W as Web App
    participant API as Order API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    U->>W: open the checkout page
    W->>API: GET /api/cart
    API-->>W: 200 cart contents
    U->>W: click Place order
    W->>API: POST /api/orders
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO orders
    DB-->>API: ok
    alt payment accepted
        API-->>W: 201 order created
        W->>API: GET /api/orders/{id}
    else payment declined
        API-->>W: 402 payment required
    end
    opt marketing consent
        W->>API: POST /api/consent
    end
    loop poll status
        W->>API: GET /api/orders/{id}/status
    end
